{"title": "10/07(三) 例行維護公告 (已結束)", "createDate": 1791280800, "content": "<p> <style>* { font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif !important; }</style></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">冒險家您好。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">為提供更加穩定的遊戲服務環境，我們將於下列時間進行例行維護作業。<br>      維護期間將無法登入遊戲，敬請冒險家提前做好準備。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">◼</span></span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護時間</span></span></span></span></h1><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- 2026</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">年10月7日(三) 上午6時 ～ 上午<s>9時</s> <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">8時40分</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt; margin-bottom:8px\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">◼</span></span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護內容</span></span></span></span></h1><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">亡靈之塔新增21-1 ～ 30-5關卡；通關特定樓層時，可獲得相關稱號。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">-</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">「楓葉朋友們：時裝幸運箱」中可獲得的粉豆服裝將變更為可染色。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">預計向維護前已獲得粉豆服裝的玩家發放「染色劑選擇箱：粉豆」 </span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">調整為可染色後，可能因解析度不同，而感覺服裝的顏色與原先有所差異。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">新增「更高的塔，更嚴峻的試煉」活動。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt; margin-bottom:8px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">◼ </span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">以下已知問題預計於本次維護進行修正</span></b></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">修正長弓兵配戴「飾品符文：崩落」後，以「震盪射擊」使黑魅魔破防時，也會啟用降臨增益。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt; margin-bottom:8px\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">◼</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護補償</span></span></span></span></h1><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">為感謝冒險家於維護期間的耐心等候，我們將發送以下補償獎勵：</span></span></span></span></p><table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"table-layout:auto; border-collapse:collapse; border:none\"> <tbody>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; background-color:#262626; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">補償道具</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; background-color:#262626; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">數量</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">精靈之翼</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">150</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">小銀幣箱</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">10</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">金幣</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">5</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">0,000</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">解除詛咒藥水</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">2</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">堤爾克那高級料理選擇箱</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">2</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr> </tbody></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護補償可於2026/10/8(四) 23:59前領取，請於期限內登入遊戲並&nbsp; 領取補償。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">道具保管期限可於遊戲內信箱確認。（信件到期時間：2026/10/10(六) 23:59）</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">透過信箱發放的限時道具，其有效期限將自信件發放時開始計算，請務必於期限內領取並使用。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">小銀幣箱的注意事項</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">使用時，獲得銀幣1個</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">使用期限至2026/10/12(一) 23:59</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,sans-serif\">✔</span></span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">注意事項</span></span></span></span></h1><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護期間若信件超過保存期限，該信件可能會被系統自動刪除。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護期間將無法登入或使用遊戲相關服務。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護時間可能依實際作業情況提前結束或延長，若有異動將透過本公告另行說明。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">請冒險家於維護開始前提前完成遊戲內相關操作，以避免資料異常或遊戲進度受到影響。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">若維護結束後資料更新未正常完成，可能會影響遊戲正常登入。請先完全關閉手機 App 或 PC 版本用戶端後，再重新登入遊戲。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護期間，PC 與手機版皆無法登入遊戲。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">維護期間，優惠碼兌換頁面可能無法正常使用。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">我們將持續努力提供更穩定的服務環境，造成不便敬請見諒。感謝各位冒險家的理解與支持。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:24px; text-indent:-18.0pt; margin-bottom:8px\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">《瑪奇 Mobile》營運團隊敬上</span></span></span></span></p>"}